Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.70,0:00:09.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（戈什）上啊！锤击连打！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:10.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.74,0:00:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.93,0:00:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.62,0:00:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来啊，站起来！还没
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.78,0:00:19.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗还没结束呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.32,0:00:22.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}求求您了，饶了我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.02,0:00:24.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我再也不不会作弊了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.21,0:00:26.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是个没劲的家伙。站起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.90,0:00:29.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德罗瓦）够了吧。戈什。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.76,0:00:33.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们真正的工作是寻找 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:36.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧……算你沾了德罗瓦的兴致的光。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.15,0:00:38.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赶紧从心园市滚出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.01,0:00:39.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.36,0:00:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混蛋东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.96,0:00:52.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.84,0:00:57.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}睡过头了浦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.70,0:01:00.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错乌拉 没错乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.23,0:01:06.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}世界决斗嘉年华 开幕式的时候乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.62,0:01:08.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也要去乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.48,0:01:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）说完就和游马他们分开{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了观察决斗者们的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.81,0:01:16.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}躲在这里的乌拉…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.39,0:01:19.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然整整一天都睡过去了乌拉～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.25,0:01:22.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不快点收集心之碎片的话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.55,0:01:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就进不了决赛乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.97,0:01:26.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.05,0:01:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大会已经是第二天了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:30.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怕剩下的全都是些强家伙乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.70,0:01:33.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是贸然去决斗万一输了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.89,0:01:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这东西被抢走就完蛋了乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.41,0:01:38.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}该怎么办才好乌拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.45,0:01:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想到了一个好主意乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.70,0:01:48.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.95,0:01:51.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 心之碎片就有 4个了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.24,0:01:53.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）再集齐1个的话就能进决赛了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.76,0:01:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！ 怎么样……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.29,0:01:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.41,0:01:59.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.65,0:02:02.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体不见了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.37,0:02:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.86,0:02:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛 那种家伙不在的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.65,0:02:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗也更好打 倒也不错啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.98,0:02:18.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）No. 我的记忆。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.41,0:02:27.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我到底是什么人？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.80,0:02:32.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（太一）咦～？ 可恶～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.82,0:02:35.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 太一！ 你在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.51,0:02:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.98,0:02:39.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助 你们看到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.55,0:02:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.10,0:02:41.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙 太过分了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.41,0:02:42.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦～ 太一也
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.55,0:02:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗嘉年华 你参加了吗乌拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.45,0:02:48.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！目标当然就是冠军啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.64,0:02:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看你这状态 心之碎片也
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.47,0:02:52.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攒了不少了吧乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.01,0:02:56.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀～ 那个啊 就是怎么也凑不齐啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.72,0:02:58.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦～？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.09,0:03:02.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到这边来乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.95,0:03:04.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂… 干嘛啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.97,0:03:05.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.85,0:03:07.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你居然集了这么多？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.83,0:03:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的心之碎片 借我一下乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.36,0:03:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！你干什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.44,0:03:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还给我！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.27,0:03:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦 找到了乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.63,0:03:22.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个心之碎片 我就收下了乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.99,0:03:23.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.40,0:03:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为交换{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.51,0:03:25.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你从这些里面
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.85,0:03:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}挑一个适合自己的心之碎片乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.71,0:03:30.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.23,0:03:31.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.97,0:03:33.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以就交换了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.93,0:03:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯…嗯。因为{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.28,0:03:38.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心之碎片有很多种类型{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.14,0:03:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不这样做就配不上嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.00,0:03:42.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是那家伙给我的心之碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.80,0:03:44.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是假的！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.20,0:03:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是糖果啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.72,0:03:48.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）糖果～！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.24,0:03:51.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我觉得奇怪舔了一下发现是甜的…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.94,0:03:54.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结果连裤子都黏糊糊的了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.30,0:03:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁让你耍小聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.57,0:03:57.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想弄到心之碎片呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.17,0:03:59.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话是这么说没错…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.85,0:04:02.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托了，帮我找德之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.72,0:04:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧，真没办法啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.58,0:04:07.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是什么～？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.60,0:04:09.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}融化了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.56,0:04:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗人～！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.31,0:04:14.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙 竟敢耍我！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.16,0:04:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}站住！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.09,0:04:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.02,0:04:18.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发生什么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.70,0:04:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}世间 不懂世间的内幕尽是些笨蛋乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.08,0:04:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托这个福 一次决斗都没打
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.47,0:04:27.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就已经集齐4个心之碎片了乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.46,0:04:32.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？ 这么说来再从这里面选1个的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.84,0:04:35.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能这样直接进决赛了乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.21,0:04:38.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶～ 德之助那家伙跑哪去了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.91,0:04:40.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然耍诈集齐心之碎片…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.26,0:04:43.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）啊！ 集齐了就是说！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.46,0:04:50.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.03,0:04:52.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈… 哈… 哈…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.72,0:04:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做好了乌拉～！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.70,0:04:56.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.26,0:04:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈…　哈…　哈…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.96,0:05:01.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心之碎片集齐了乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.51,0:05:03.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（高修）哦～　已经集齐了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.66,0:05:05.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这不是干劲十足嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.68,0:05:08.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说难道说　你是第一个到的乌拉！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.54,0:05:09.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太棒了乌拉～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.95,0:05:12.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}晋级决赛　第一个到乌拉～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.58,0:05:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼…　你　舔舔那玩意儿试试。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.95,0:05:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乌拉？　舔心之碎片吗乌拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.14,0:05:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可　可是　心之碎片不是用来舔的东西乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.01,0:05:25.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再　再说一直放在口袋里　很脏的乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.38,0:05:28.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我就帮你塞进那张嘴里怎么样！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.57,0:05:30.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我舔乌拉！　舔就行了吧乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.93,0:05:37.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.16,0:05:40.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}融化了乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.69,0:05:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 融化了乌拉！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.38,0:05:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乌拉～！这 是糖乌拉～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.91,0:05:48.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真小气啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.23,0:05:49.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别开玩笑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.78,0:05:51.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好痛痛痛……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.81,0:05:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.50,0:05:57.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 那家伙 是什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.03,0:05:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…… 不是我乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.80,0:06:00.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…… 是被骗了乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.73,0:06:03.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乌拉～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.81,0:06:09.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）噫～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.97,0:06:11.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.00,0:06:12.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜…… 呜……。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.85,0:06:14.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老实点！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.55,0:06:15.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.59,0:06:07.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.06,0:07:50.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还不老实点吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.25,0:07:52.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要乌拉～！不想去乌拉～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.43,0:07:54.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.78,0:07:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.80,0:07:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.60,0:08:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打算把德之助怎么样！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.00,0:08:02.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛啊，你这混蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.19,0:08:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈，你是……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.21,0:08:07.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那时候那个吵死人的小子……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.75,0:08:10.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.10,0:08:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助我问你打算把他怎么样啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.97,0:08:15.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙伪造了心之碎片。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.99,0:08:17.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为惩罚，卡组没收。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.68,0:08:21.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗嘉年华的参加权永久剥夺！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.21,0:08:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让他再也无法决斗，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.10,0:08:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把他从心之陆地城赶出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.26,0:08:27.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等……等一下啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.61,0:08:29.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没必要做到那种地步吧……！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.80,0:08:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没必要？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.32,0:08:33.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙亵渎了神圣的决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.18,0:08:33.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.68,0:08:36.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就是没法容忍这种事！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.70,0:08:38.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.55,0:08:40.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}浦拉～！救命啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.74,0:08:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我只是一时鬼迷心窍啊浦拉～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.65,0:08:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.95,0:08:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实，德之助做的事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.80,0:08:49.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也许并不是能被原谅的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.50,0:08:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但也不至于做到那种地步吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.35,0:08:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是决斗者的话，就用决斗来分胜负！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.55,0:08:58.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是你们想带走德之助就跟我决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.59,0:09:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗？有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.78,0:09:03.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过我可是很强的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.80,0:09:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，正合我意！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.74,0:09:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们两个一起上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.34,0:09:09.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吧。决斗是2对1。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.87,0:09:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你和我们两个人决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.05,0:09:14.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要能打倒其中任何一个人就算你赢。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.42,0:09:16.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的事，我就当忘了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.61,0:09:18.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 输掉的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.63,0:09:22.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就由你来承受同样的惩罚。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.83,0:09:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.87,0:09:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会…！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.35,0:09:27.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样？ 这样你还要接受吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.54,0:09:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.90,0:09:32.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.93,0:09:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！ 明明连战斗的干劲都没有{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.79,0:09:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还装得像个像样的决斗者！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.49,0:09:39.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.87,0:09:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗 我接受了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.03,0:09:46.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么～？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.06,0:09:47.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.92,0:09:50.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 要是输了 卡组会被夺走
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.31,0:09:52.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也没法参加嘉年华了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.46,0:09:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且星光体也不在吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.48,0:09:57.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马一个人要对付两个人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.18,0:09:59.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样太乱来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.36,0:10:04.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算这样　也不能把德之助把同伴丢下不管啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.41,0:10:05.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.25,0:10:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有多大能耐{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.60,0:10:08.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我来当你的对手！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.29,0:10:12.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧～　就凭你们这些家伙我怎么可能输啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.35,0:10:16.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘　设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.40,0:10:22.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜　设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.43,0:10:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘　设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.18,0:10:33.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿嘿嘿。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.25,0:10:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR影像　连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.29,0:10:45.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（3人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.15,0:11:16.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.64,0:11:21.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行…　再往下什么都想不起来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.85,0:11:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且　和快斗的那场决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.55,0:11:28.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马和我引发的那个奇迹…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.92,0:11:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}泽阿尔的力量究竟是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.51,0:11:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……你要开始决斗了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.03,0:11:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也得去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.38,0:11:43.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（No.96）好久不见了，星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.57,0:11:46.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（No.96）呵呵呵呵……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.43,0:11:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.12,0:11:50.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.96！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.37,0:11:58.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.89,0:12:00.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解开了封印！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.74,0:12:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，那个啊是我们 No.卡全体的总意。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.94,0:12:06.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.30,0:12:08.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.87,0:12:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赶紧结束吧，戈什。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.05,0:12:18.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.58,0:12:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体不在！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.77,0:12:22.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的，太乱来了乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.29,0:12:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马怎么可能赢过那两个人乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.98,0:12:27.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！到底是为了谁啊你以为是在为谁战斗啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.35,0:12:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君，加油乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.04,0:12:32.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那还用说！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.06,0:12:34.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种家伙我一个人就够了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.08,0:12:37.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.78,0:12:41.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我以里侧守备表示盖放一只怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.82,0:12:45.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再盖放一张卡回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.19,0:12:49.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，嘴上说得那么狂一上来就守备加固吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.23,0:12:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔，这场决斗我可不能输啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.27,0:12:57.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么其他的 No.怪兽们会把力量给你……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.14,0:12:58.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我应该说过。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.34,0:13:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是 No.怪兽们的总意。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.01,0:13:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和你一样，世界的破灭啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.21,0:13:06.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破灭！？不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.07,0:13:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说是我期望的吗期望世界的破灭！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.60,0:13:12.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不然的话我为什么会在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.32,0:13:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.01,0:13:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 幻蝶刺客摩芙！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.58,0:13:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵 哦——呵呵呵！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.60,0:13:31.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再盖两张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.81,0:13:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力1200…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.50,0:13:37.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟敢向我们挑战我会让你后悔的！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.71,0:13:40.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.24,0:13:43.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 重锤猛击拳手特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.98,0:13:49.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 只有在对方场上有{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.16,0:13:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽以及 魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.96,0:13:52.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡存在时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.86,0:13:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.39,0:13:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力2300！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.57,0:14:00.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}突然就召唤等级6的怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.77,0:14:02.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 就这样回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.13,0:14:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 不管从哪边尽管放马过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.32,0:14:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《对方是攻击力1200和2300的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.36,0:14:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的手牌是……》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.06,0:14:15.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！ 要打倒的对手定好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.28,0:14:17.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.28,0:14:22.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把里侧守备表示的怪兽变成攻击表示！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.99,0:14:26.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 雷骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.36,0:14:28.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 攻击力1200。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.72,0:14:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用这种没劲的怪兽能干什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.92,0:14:33.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿 你看着吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.76,0:14:36.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我召唤助骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.68,0:14:43.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 这样就用助骑士打倒莫尔弗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.54,0:14:45.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再用雷骑士直接攻击的话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.77,0:14:47.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能造成大伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.25,0:14:52.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 帮救骑士！ 攻击魔尔芙！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.09,0:14:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}援护冲撞！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.80,0:14:57.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 永续陷阱发动隶属的鳞粉！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.51,0:15:01.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在对方怪兽攻击过来时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.04,0:15:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会成为那只怪兽的装备卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.73,0:15:06.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将表示形式从攻击表示变为守备表示！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.93,0:15:08.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.00,0:15:15.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}帮救骑士的攻击 被躲开了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.69,0:15:17.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来 你的节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.67,0:15:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一下子就被打乱了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.41,0:15:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.93,0:15:25.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然没有星光体在的话根本赢不了乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.12,0:15:29.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么星光体不出来乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.83,0:15:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 想起来吧 星光体你的使命。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.39,0:15:40.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 现身吧 星光体到我们身边来。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.43,0:15:42.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.14,0:15:47.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.84,0:15:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.87,0:15:54.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普 你是不打算站到我们这边吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.75,0:16:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好啊 那就先从你这家伙开始吸收！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.64,0:16:05.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 黑雾！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.61,0:16:19.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.66,0:16:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤幻蝶刺客 凤蝶！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.56,0:16:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 永续陷阱 隶属的鳞粉第二效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.10,0:16:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡一回合一次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.79,0:16:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以改变装备怪兽的表示形式。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.32,0:16:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把帮一把骑士变成攻击表示！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.86,0:16:42.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是打算用幻蝶刺客 凤蝶来攻击吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.73,0:16:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过伤害只有攻击力之差
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.89,0:16:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}100点而已！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.60,0:16:50.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太天真了 幻蝶的刺客摩尔福的怪兽效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.64,0:16:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次 对方怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.87,0:16:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}表示形式发生变化时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.68,0:16:56.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其攻击力和守备力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.36,0:16:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降1000点。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.39,0:16:59.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.32,0:17:01.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}救星骑士的攻击力！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.75,0:17:06.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用幻蝶的刺客摩尔福攻击救星骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.96,0:17:08.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蓝鳞激流！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.86,0:17:16.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.23,0:17:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且幻蝶的刺客扬羽的怪兽效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.60,0:17:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡以外的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.45,0:17:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对方伤害时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.31,0:17:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.88,0:17:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降那个伤害的数值。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.69,0:17:32.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连莱莱德的攻击力都下降了乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.72,0:17:36.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后以幻蝶刺客 凤蝶攻击莱莱德！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.10,0:17:38.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲜艳鳞粉流！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.82,0:17:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.82,0:17:53.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.37,0:17:55.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值2400！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.19,0:17:58.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一口气被干掉了1600点乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.71,0:18:00.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我还以为你多少有点骨气{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.57,0:18:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就凭那点水平
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.86,0:18:04.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还装什么一决斗者呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.44,0:18:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笑死人了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.50,0:18:06.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你才是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.46,0:18:07.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这点伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.85,0:18:10.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这么从容真的好吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.16,0:18:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胜负现在才要开始呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.52,0:18:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么～！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.70,0:18:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动莱莱德的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.73,0:18:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和这张卡战斗过的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.09,0:18:21.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下个对手的回合 不能战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.45,0:18:24.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 那种气势又怎样。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.80,0:18:26.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的场地已经空空如也。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.16,0:18:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管怎样在我的回合就结束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.36,0:18:32.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.93,0:18:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！黑雾！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.68,0:18:48.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.71,0:18:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 利刃拳手！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.91,0:18:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喔～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.27,0:18:55.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 用重锤猛击拳手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.98,0:18:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.47,0:18:59.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡攻击的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.99,0:19:01.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己的场地上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.02,0:19:03.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有魔法 陷阱卡的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.02,0:19:04.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对手玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.10,0:19:06.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不能发动魔法 陷阱卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.90,0:19:09.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 不管你盖了什么卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.59,0:19:11.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那玩意都用不了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.28,0:19:15.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙… 所以才没有盖卡吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.81,0:19:17.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了乌拉！这攻击要是打中的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.51,0:19:20.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马的生命值就只剩100了乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.87,0:19:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 铁锤猛击拳击手！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.73,0:19:25.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.55,0:19:26.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜噢～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.59,0:19:28.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.00,0:19:34.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.58,0:19:36.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被…被打中了乌拉…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.53,0:19:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼… 嘴上功夫倒是不错嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.56,0:19:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来 用利刃拳击手给你致命一击！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.25,0:19:46.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈 哈 哈…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.13,0:19:48.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？生命值变成1600了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.85,0:19:55.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽保护了他！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.04,0:19:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我守卫者
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.15,0:19:58.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在被直接攻击的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.08,0:20:00.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌可以以攻击表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.77,0:20:02.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 通过丢弃1张手牌{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.29,0:20:06.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让战斗的破坏无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.32,0:20:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在锤击猛冲拳击手的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.16,0:20:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击的同时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.85,0:20:12.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤我我我守卫者降低伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.72,0:20:14.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再丢弃1张手牌{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.41,0:20:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}躲过了我我我守卫者的破坏吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.63,0:20:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 但是 怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.49,0:20:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力部分的差值 还是要受到伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.51,0:20:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我守卫者的攻击力是 1500。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.37,0:20:31.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 攻击力1800的刀锋拳击手攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.24,0:20:34.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 直线斩击！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.28,0:20:35.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才不会让你得逞！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.88,0:20:36.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.63,0:20:40.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 我丢弃1张手牌{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.16,0:20:43.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动我我我守卫者的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.88,0:20:48.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.58,0:20:49.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.02,0:20:51.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又受到300点伤害了乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.28,0:20:54.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过，这样一来战斗就结束了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.81,0:20:56.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总算是保住了我我我守卫者…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.66,0:20:58.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可不好说？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.18,0:21:02.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动刀刃保镖的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.22,0:21:05.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽可以通过再丢弃1张手牌{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.92,0:21:07.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再次向对方怪兽攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.77,0:21:09.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再来一次！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.79,0:21:11.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的手牌有4张…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.66,0:21:13.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}算上这次攻击{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.16,0:21:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还能再攻击5次乌拉…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.19,0:21:17.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，刀刃保镖！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.92,0:21:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击我我我守卫者！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.73,0:21:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直线斩击！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.92,0:21:25.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我守卫者！我丢弃1张手牌{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.78,0:21:28.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我守卫者的怪兽效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.84,0:21:33.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.36,0:21:34.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔咕…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.98,0:21:36.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.06,0:21:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 你这家伙的手牌就是零了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.92,0:21:40.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}照这个架势 你已经
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.09,0:21:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没法再用我我我守卫者的效果了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.29,0:21:44.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.47,0:21:45.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}死心吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.61,0:21:48.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刀锋弹舞者的怪兽效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.52,0:21:51.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喔噢～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.71,0:21:53.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 刀锋弹舞者！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.61,0:21:55.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击我我我守卫者！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.42,0:21:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.69,0:21:57.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喔噢～！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.65,0:22:04.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我守卫者！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.84,0:22:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喔噢～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.07,0:24:12.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你知道你的房间里
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.53,0:24:14.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有时候会出现老鼠吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.27,0:24:16.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的假的！？得赶紧消灭掉才行！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.46,0:24:17.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.45,0:24:19.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要把它培养成出色的决斗者。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.49,0:24:22.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我给它取名叫小游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.35,0:24:24.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们这不是混得挺熟了嘛！

